The required piece is an \(S\)-shaped tetromino (4 squares).

In the given \(5\times5\) diagram, four cells form such a shape:
\[
\begin{matrix}
 &\heartsuit&\clubsuit\\
\diamondsuit&\clubsuit&
\end{matrix}
\]
from rows 3–4, columns 1–3. Rotating this piece by \(180^\circ\) gives:
\[
\begin{matrix}
\clubsuit&\diamondsuit\\
\clubsuit&\heartsuit
\end{matrix}
\]
which is exactly the piece shown in choice B.

Therefore, the obtainable piece is
\[
\boxed{\text{B}}
\]
